@format 1
@id queue.create-saved-edit-work
@title Create edit work from saved plans
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Create one edit item for each listed source whose sidecar contains an active saved plan, then repair unknown durations.
@section I. UI
@tabs Edit
@flow TB
@related queue.create-edit-work, edit.restore-plan

@alias ui = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LEdit
@alias edit = Cadroue.Application.LEdit
@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule
@alias sidecar = Cadroue.Media.LSidecarStore

[input] Add All edit request <input>
- Receive priority, listed sources, output preset, and relay routing @ ui.LEditAllDescribe(...)
> plans

[plans] Read saved plans <decision>
- Read each source's saved edit plan @ ui.LEditPlanRead(...)
- Skip sources without an active saved plan @ ui.LEditAllDescribe(...)
? "No active saved plan is found" > rejected
? "At least one active plan is found" > build

[build] Build and persist items <storage>
- Create one work item per active plan, preserving or assigning its source batch @ edit.LEditWorkCreate(...)
- Apply the source-tab title and add relay lineage to the schedule @ schedule.LScheduleAdd(...)
> duration

[duration] Resolve missing durations <process>
- Resolve missing durations in bounded parallel work @ sidecar.LSidecarDurationResolve(...)
- Update affected persisted schedule records @ schedule.LScheduleDurationSet(...)
> result

[result] Saved edit plans queued <output>
= Every listed source with an active saved plan becomes pending edit work.

[rejected] Nothing queued <output>
= Sources without active saved plans are left untouched.
